      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>CAELNOR — level 3 PC, Aelrathil (sun-elf) escapee. Fey Ancestry: advantage on saves vs. being charmed, magic can't put her to sleep. Emberlight's flash also lights the area for 1 round (toggle token light). Tally-stake can snap off in a wound: target has disadvantage on its next save against her (adjudicate manually).</p>"
